  "description": "High-throughput, low-allocation, fuzz-resistant DICOM toolkit for .NET: Part 10 parsing that never throws on bad data, multi-gigabyte files with lazy pixel data, async C-ECHO / C-STORE SCP and SCU on System.IO.Pipelines, parallel batch processing, attribute mapping, PS3.15-style anonymization and channel-routed audit logging. Commercial license with a 7-day trial.",
